= First National Congress of the Zhongguo Guomindang

At Guangzhou, hundreds of delegates arrive as the Guomindang holds its first ever National Congress, solidifying its reorganization under a Leninist system. Many members of the KMT celebrate this important milestone and many hope that the next years will be good times for the KMT.
